    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Successful Candidate Onboarding\n\n**Purpose:**  \nAutomate onboarding for candidates who passed the recruitment process.\n\n**Steps:**  \n1. Add the candidate to the **Passed Candidates** Google Sheet.  \n2. Send a **welcome email** with required documents and onboarding instructions.  \n3. Retrieve the **department manager info** for internal reference.\n\n",
        "height": 672,
        "width": 512
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -224,
        -448
      ],
      "id": "257d2e6c-fb56-42ee-81c0-0b51431f58e5",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New Hire Notification & IT Setup Workflow\n\n**Purpose:**  \nNotify relevant departments when a new employee joins and request necessary IT setup.\n\n**Steps:**  \n1. **Send Email to Department Manager**  \n   - Inform the manager about the new team member.  \n   - Include position, department, and onboarding steps.\n\n2. **Send Email to IT Department**  \n   - Request creation of company email and access to systems.  \n   - Assign Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for necessary tools.  \n   - Ensure credentials are sent securely to HR for distribution.\n",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 480
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        304,
        -448
      ],
      "id": "9322c15b-8b5e-4d2c-bfc0-841e8f3b22ec",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    }
